!Name: p90forwlwss-2
!C A period 90 c/3 puffer which produces a forwards LWSS stream which races
!C ahead of the puffer.  This is built using two p90 c/3 forwards rakes and a
!C p90 c/3 backwards rake.  The reaction of the three gliders to form a LWSS
!C uses a reaction by David Buckingham.  The LWSS stream itself has a pseudo-
!C period of 30.
!C David I. Bell, June 1996
!Source: jslife-moving
